I'm not sure what you're asking, so let's back up a bit, ok?  :)

In the normal dungeon, you should enter a level and see the message "So
and so needs urgent help at the questhomelevelname!  Look for a -ic
transporter."  

On that level, you will find a magic transporter, represented as a pink
'^'.  When you step on the '^', you'll be transported to your quest home
level.  On that level, you need to find your quest leader.  Once you
talk to your quest leader, you need to find stairs leading down.

If you can't find your quest leader or the stairs, tell us what class
you're playing and we can help.

